{
  "version": "missing-or-unconsumed-nonce-in-state-changing-signature-v1",
  "description": "Phase-74 RESEARCH-ONLY + REVIEW-ONLY Signature-Replay detector for the NARROW missing/unconsumed-nonce shape ONLY: a state-changing action authorized by a verified signature whose signed payload has NO nonce (or a nonce that is never consumed) and is NOT protected by an enforced single-use consume guard (nonce-consume / check-gated digest-order-claim mapping). Out of scope (do NOT handle): domain-separator chainId/verifyingContract bugs, cross-chain replay, missing-deadline-only, EIP-1271 edge cases, abi.encodePacked collision, wrong-signer authorization. Read ONLY by scripts/signature_replay_nonce_detector.py (un-wired). Emits ONLY REVIEW_ONLY_ADVANCE/REVIEW_ONLY_ABSTAIN/REVIEW_ONLY_REJECTED. Generic only — NO subject identifiers. is_gate:false research_only:true review_only:true routes_in_production:false routed_manifest_ids:[].",
